"Digits after the separator: 2 for most currencies, 0 for currencies such as "
"the yen."
msgstr ""
"Cifre dopo il separatore: 2 per la maggior parte delle valute, 0 per valute "
"come lo yen."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:766
msgid "Minus sign position"
msgstr "Posizione segno meno"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:767
msgid ""
"For refunds and discounts: before the symbol gives -$5.00; after gives "
"$-5.00."
msgstr ""
"Per rimborsi e sconti: prima che il simbolo dia -$5,00; dopo dà $-5,00."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:771
msgid "Before the symbol"
msgstr "Prima del simbolo"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:772
msgid "After the symbol"
msgstr "Dopo il simbolo"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:784
msgid "Add currency"
msgstr "Aggiungi valuta"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:786
msgid "Exchange rates"
msgstr "Cambio"

